Z||000006||Eric||02-05-2001||09:16 PM||||If you left the bumper seams intact, then it should be possible, if not quite easy, to glass in the rest of the seams.  The thing about this would be to plan it out well in advance.  You may have to remove panels, refit them, remove them again, glass the panels, and then reinstall them once again.  I'm sure it's a lot more work than any of us would expect, but the result speaks for itself.||||reg||1
