Z||000012||TOM||02-06-2001||12:42 AM||||But only the back fenders are glass. The doors, the front fenders, and the rear fascia are urethane. Rigid glass doesnt stick too well to urethane. You will have to use a flex resin. I think around a 50/50 flex/rigid mixture would probably be ok. But not having tried it I dont know for sure. ||||reg||1
